      "text": "- id: BR-LM-001\r\n    statement: |\r\n      When at least one note exists for an account, the account card displays\r\n      \"Last Note Added by [User] on MM/DD/YYYY\" in the top-right corner, positioned\r\n      below the \"Assigned to [user] on MM/DD/YYYY\" line.\r\n    priority: High\r\n    note: \"Per SERV-12337: new Last Note Added indicator on account cards across Repo, Skip, and Assignment dashboards.\"\r\n    ticket_references: [SERV-12337]"
    },
    {
      "id": "BR-LM-002",
      "text": "- id: BR-LM-002\r\n    statement: |\r\n      The Last Note Added indicator always reflects the most recent note — when a new note\r\n      is saved, the indicator updates to the new note's user name and date.\r\n    priority: High\r\n    note: \"Per SERV-12337: indicator updates on each note save to reflect the most recent entry.\"\r\n    ticket_references: [SERV-12337]"
